    <bpmn:process id="W_W35" name="W35. Management Reporting Rhythm" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Reporting calendar (daily, weekly, monthly, quarterly cadences)
Frequency: Daily flash, weekly review, monthly close reporting, quarterly board pack
Volume: ~50 standard reports on recurring schedules; ~20 ad-hoc requests/month
Owner: Controller
Participants: Controller, CFO, CEO, Department Heads, BI Analyst
Source: workflow W35 — Management Reporting Rhythm</bpmn:documentation>
