    <bpmn:process id="W_W39" name="W39. Fixed Asset Disposal &amp; Retirement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Asset reaches end of useful life, becomes uneconomic to maintain, or is replaced by new asset
Frequency: ~50–100 asset disposals/year; peaks during store renovations and IT refresh cycles
Volume: ~5,000–8,000 fixed assets across all entities (POS terminals, forklifts, vehicles, fixtures, IT servers, office equipment; per W661)
Owner: Cost Accountant
Participants: Cost Accountant, Requestor (dept), CFO, IT (for IT assets), Procurement (if resale), Legal (if land/building)
Source: workflow W39 — Fixed Asset Disposal &amp; Retirement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W39_LaneSet7">
        <bpmn:lane id="W39_Lane1" name="Requestor">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W39_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W39_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W39_Task16</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W39_Start8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W39_Lane2" name="Cost Accountant">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W39_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W39_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W39_Task17</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W39_Task19</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W39_Lane3" name="Approver">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W39_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W39_Lane4" name="Procurement">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W39_Task14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W39_Lane5" name="IT Team">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W39_Task15</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W39_Lane6" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W39_Task18</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W39_End20</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W39_Start8" name="Asset reaches end of useful life, becomes uneconomic to maintain, or is replaced by new…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W39_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W39_Task9" name="Requestor identifies asset for disposal: reason (end of life, beyond repair…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Requestor identifies asset for disposal: reason (end of life, beyond repair, obsolete, replacement, store closure)
Responsible (R): Requestor (Dept. Head)
Accountable (A): Dept. Head
Duration: 15 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W39_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W39_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W39_Task10" name="Cost Accountant reviews asset record: original cost, accumulated depreciation…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Cost Accountant reviews asset record: original cost, accumulated depreciation, net book value (NBV), remaining useful life, any outstanding encumbrances
Responsible (R): Cost Accountant
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: 15 min/asset</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W39_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W39_Flow25</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W39_Task11" name="If NBV is material (&gt; PHP 50,000): Requestor obtains disposal valuation or…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: If NBV is material (&gt; PHP 50,000): Requestor obtains disposal valuation or market quotation for resale
Responsible (R): Requestor
Accountable (A): Dept. Head
Duration: 1–2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W39_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W39_Flow26</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W39_Task12" name="Disposal request routed for approval per tier: (a) NBV ≤ PHP 50,000…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Disposal request routed for approval per tier: (a) NBV ≤ PHP 50,000: Controller, (b) NBV PHP 50,001–500,000: CFO, (c) NBV &gt; PHP 500,000: CEO, (d) Land/building: Board
Responsible (R): Approver
Accountable (A): Approver
Duration: 15–30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W39_Flow26</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W39_Flow27</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W39_Task13" name="Cost Accountant determines disposal method: (a) trade-in (against new asset…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Cost Accountant determines disposal method: (a) trade-in (against new asset purchase), (b) public sale/auction, (c) scrap/recycle, (d) donation, (e) write-off (no residual value)
Responsible (R): Cost Accountant
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: 15 min/asset</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W39_Flow27</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W39_Flow28</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W39_Task14" name="If sale: Procurement or Admin conducts sale; system records proceeds">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: If sale: Procurement or Admin conducts sale; system records proceeds
Responsible (R): Procurement / Admin
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: Varies</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W39_Flow28</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W39_Flow29</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W39_Task15" name="If IT asset: IT ensures data wipe and compliance with Data Privacy Act (RA…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: If IT asset: IT ensures data wipe and compliance with Data Privacy Act (RA 10173) before physical disposal
Responsible (R): IT Team
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: 30 min/asset</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W39_Flow29</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W39_Flow30</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W39_Task16" name="Physical disposal or handover executed; asset tag removed; documented with…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: Physical disposal or handover executed; asset tag removed; documented with photos
Responsible (R): Requestor / Admin
Accountable (A): Dept. Head
Duration: 30 min/asset</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W39_Flow30</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W39_Flow31</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W39_Task17" name="Cost Accountant posts disposal entry in system: (a) remove asset at original…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 9: Cost Accountant posts disposal entry in system: (a) remove asset at original cost from fixed asset register, (b) remove accumulated depreciation, (c) recognize gain/loss on disposal = proceeds − NBV (or NBV if scrapped), (d) post to GL disposal P&amp;L account
Responsible (R): Cost Accountant
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: 15 min/asset</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W39_Flow31</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W39_Flow32</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W39_Task18" name="System updates fixed asset register; asset status changed to &quot;Disposed&quot; with…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 10: System updates fixed asset register; asset status changed to &quot;Disposed&quot; with disposal date; asset no longer depreciated
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W39_Flow32</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W39_Flow33</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W39_Task19" name="Quarterly: Cost Accountant reviews disposed assets report; reconciles disposal…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 11: Quarterly: Cost Accountant reviews disposed assets report; reconciles disposal gain/loss to GL
Responsible (R): Cost Accountant
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: 30 min/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W39_Flow33</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W39_Flow34</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W39_End20" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W39_Flow34</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W39_Annotation21">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-26 (control fixed asset disposals.) | - operational: Cost Accountant review and approval gate; operational: periodic reconciliation against source documents
Owner: Cost Accountant</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W39_Assoc22" sourceRef="W39_Annotation21" targetRef="W39_Start8" associationDirection="None" />
