        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-292 (ensure controlled execution — FP&amp;A &amp; Reporting (PA-17.4).) | - operational: Fixed Asset Accountant review and approval gate; operational: periodic reconciliation against source documents
Owner: Fixed Asset Accountant</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
