    <bpmn:process id="W_W1406" name="W1406. Weekly Flash Sales Report, Chain-Wide KPI Dashboard &amp; Executive Performance Summary" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Weekly cadence: every Monday morning, auto-generated from prior week&#x27;s transaction data
Frequency: Weekly; 52 weeks/year
Volume: 1 chain-wide flash report + 4 regional summaries + 200 store-level detail pages per week
Owner: FP&amp;A Analyst
Participants: FP&amp;A Analyst, FP&amp;A Manager, VP Store Operations, CMO, CFO, CEO
Source: workflow W1406 — Weekly Flash Sales Report, Chain-Wide KPI Dashboard &amp; Executive Performance Summary</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1406_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1406_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1406_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1406_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1406_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1406_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1406_Lane2" name="FP&amp;A Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1406_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1406_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1406_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1406_Lane3" name="CEO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1406_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1406_End13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1406_Start5" name="Weekly cadence: every Monday morning, auto-generated from prior week&#x27;s transaction data">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1406_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1406_Task6" name="System auto-extracts prior week&#x27;s (Monday–Sunday) transaction data from POS…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: System auto-extracts prior week&#x27;s (Monday–Sunday) transaction data from POS, ecommerce, and trade account systems: total revenue by store, by region, and by channel; transaction count; average transaction value (ATV); units per transaction (UPT); sales per sqm; sales per employee
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated (runs at 6:00 AM Monday)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1406_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1406_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1406_Task7" name="System calculates key metrics and comparisons: (a) week-over-week revenue…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: System calculates key metrics and comparisons: (a) week-over-week revenue change (% and PHP), (b) same-week-prior-year revenue change (% and PHP), (c) week-to-date (WTD) revenue vs. weekly budget target, (d) month-to-date (MTD) revenue vs. monthly budget target, (e) year-to-date (YTD) revenue vs. annual budget target, (f) top 10 and bottom 10 stores by revenue growth vs. prior year, (g) ecommerce revenue as % of total, (h) BOPIS vs. delivery order split, (i) trade/B2B revenue as % of total, (j) promotional revenue as % of total (from active promotions per W83)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1406_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1406_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1406_Task8" name="System generates visual dashboard with: (a) chain-wide revenue trend (13-week…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: System generates visual dashboard with: (a) chain-wide revenue trend (13-week rolling chart), (b) regional revenue waterfall (5 store regions per profile §3.1: Mindanao, Visayas, Luzon-outside-NCR, Metro Manila, North/Central Luzon), (c) store heat map (green/yellow/red by performance vs. budget), (d) top 10 / bottom 10 store list, (e) category revenue breakdown (Lumber, Tiles, Plumbing, etc.), (f) ecommerce channel metrics, (g) executive KPI scorecard
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1406_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1406_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1406_Task9" name="FP&amp;A Analyst reviews auto-generated flash report for data quality: verifies POS…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: FP&amp;A Analyst reviews auto-generated flash report for data quality: verifies POS revenue totals reconcile to daily cash/card/e-wallet settlements (W5F, W537, W1268), flags stores with missing or anomalous data (e.g., store showing zero revenue for a day — possible POS system issue), and adds narrative commentary on notable items (weather events, typhoons, holidays, competitor openings)
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A Analyst
Accountable (A): FP&amp;A Manager
Duration: 1 hour/week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1406_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1406_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1406_Task10" name="FP&amp;A Analyst publishes weekly flash report by 9:00 AM Monday: (a) executive…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: FP&amp;A Analyst publishes weekly flash report by 9:00 AM Monday: (a) executive summary email with chain-wide KPIs and 3–5 bullet-point commentary to CEO, CFO, COO, CMO, VP Store Operations; (b) detailed dashboard link in ERP portal for self-service drill-down; (c) regional summaries auto-distributed to Regional Managers
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A Analyst
Accountable (A): FP&amp;A Manager
Duration: 30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1406_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1406_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1406_Task11" name="Tuesday executive stand-up">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Tuesday executive stand-up: CEO, CFO, COO review flash report in 15-minute stand-up; identify any stores or regions requiring immediate intervention; assign action items (e.g., CMO to investigate declining category, VP Store Operations to visit bottom-10 store)
Responsible (R): CEO / CFO / COO
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 15 min/week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1406_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1406_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1406_Task12" name="Thursday follow-up">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Thursday follow-up: FP&amp;A Analyst distributes mid-week update (Wednesday + Thursday partial data) if flash report showed significant variances (&gt; 10% below weekly target chain-wide or any region &gt; 15% below); mid-week update is a simplified 1-page email
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A Analyst
Accountable (A): FP&amp;A Manager
Duration: 30 min (only when triggered)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1406_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1406_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1406_End13" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1406_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1406_Annotation14">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-292 (ensure controlled execution — FP&amp;A &amp; Reporting (PA-17.4).) | - operational: FP&amp;A Analyst review and approval gate; operational: periodic reconciliation against source documents
Owner: FP&amp;A Analyst</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1406_Assoc15" sourceRef="W1406_Annotation14" targetRef="W1406_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
