    <bpmn:process id="W_W5528" name="W5528. Accounting Policy, Technical Accounting (PFRS) Position &amp; New-Standard Adoption Governance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New or amended PFRS issuance or effective-date trigger on the FRSC/SEC calendar; a new or novel transaction lacking a policy (new revenue stream per the VS-157 onboarding, a new lease structure per VS-148, a new financing instrument); an external-audit management-letter finding on accounting treatment (W351); or the annual accounting-policy-manual review
Frequency: Annual manual review; per-adoption assessment on issuance; per-transaction position paper; annual external-audit concurrence cycle
Volume: 5 legal entities on one PFRS policy set; ~30 new/amended standard items assessed/year; ~8 technical position papers/year; ~1,000+ GL account mappings governed by the policy manual
Owner: Controller
Participants: Chief Accountant, Accounting Manager, Tax Compliance Manager (PAS 12 interplay), FP&amp;A Manager, Head of Internal Audit, External Auditors (engagement partner), Legal Counsel (entity/contract matters)
Source: workflow W5528 — Accounting Policy, Technical Accounting (PFRS) Position &amp; New-Standard Adoption Governance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5528_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5528_Lane1" name="Chief Accountant">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5528_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5528_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5528_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5528_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5528_Lane2" name="Accounting Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5528_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5528_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5528_Lane3" name="Controller">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5528_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5528_End12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5528_Start5" name="New or amended PFRS issuance or effective-date trigger on the FRSC/SEC calendar; a new or…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5528_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5528_Task6" name="Standards radar &amp; adoption assessment">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Standards radar &amp; adoption assessment: monitor the FRSC/SEC issuance calendar; for each new or amended PFRS produce an impact assessment (recognition, measurement, disclosure, systems) and an adoption roadmap with W1409-gated system/configuration changes and an accounting-team training note
Responsible (R): Chief Accountant
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: 6 hours/item midpoint × ~30 items/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5528_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5528_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5528_Task7" name="Policy manual maintenance">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Policy manual maintenance: annual review of the accounting policy manual across the 5 entities (recognition, measurement and presentation policies, including the W1875 lease policy and the VS-157 revenue policies), version-controlled under W186
Responsible (R): Chief Accountant / Accounting Manager
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: 24 hours/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5528_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5528_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5528_Task8" name="Technical position papers">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Technical position papers: for novel transactions, a written position (facts, relevant PFRS, conclusion, audit-concurrence note) filed before first posting; complex contract accounting coordinated with the VS-157 onboarding gate
Responsible (R): Chief Accountant
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: 9 hours/paper midpoint × ~8 papers/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5528_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5528_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5528_Task9" name="Close-integration &amp; disclosure control">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Close-integration &amp; disclosure control: policy changes folded into the W9 close instructions and the W638 JE review checklists; disclosure checklists updated for SEC/BIR filings re-verified at W481
Responsible (R): Accounting Manager
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: 8 hours/quarter × 4</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5528_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5528_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5528_Task10" name="External-audit concurrence">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: External-audit concurrence: position papers and policy elections tabled with the engagement partner during the W351 PBC cycle; management-letter treatment points dispositioned and closed
Responsible (R): Controller
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 8 hours/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5528_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5528_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5528_Task11" name="Training &amp; communication">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Training &amp; communication: policy-change briefings to the entity accounting teams; quick-reference cards for store/DC finance users on affected transactions
Responsible (R): Accounting Manager
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: 8 hours/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5528_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5528_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5528_End12" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5528_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5528_Annotation13">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-292 (ensure controlled execution — FP&amp;A &amp; Reporting (PA-17.4).) | - operational: no novel transaction posts without an approved position paper | - operational: annual policy-manual review completed before the W9 year-end close
Owner: Controller</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W5528_Assoc14" sourceRef="W5528_Annotation13" targetRef="W5528_Start5" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5528_Flow15" sourceRef="W5528_Start5" targetRef="W5528_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5528_Flow16" sourceRef="W5528_Task6" targetRef="W5528_Task7" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5528_Flow17" sourceRef="W5528_Task7" targetRef="W5528_Task8" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5528_Flow18" sourceRef="W5528_Task8" targetRef="W5528_Task9" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5528_Flow19" sourceRef="W5528_Task9" targetRef="W5528_Task10" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5528_Flow20" sourceRef="W5528_Task10" targetRef="W5528_Task11" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W5528_Flow21" sourceRef="W5528_Task11" targetRef="W5528_End12" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W5528_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W5528_plane" bpmnElement="W_W5528">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W5528_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W5528_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="1580" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
