    <bpmn:process id="W_W5531" name="W5531. PFRS 8 Operating-Segment Reporting, CODM Disclosure Package &amp; Segment-Note Production" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: The annual AFS cycle (W9B year-end close feeding the W481 SEC filing calendar); a change in the CODM&#x27;s operating-review structure (W1653 monthly executive performance review, W231 QBR, W102/W1656 category reviews); a portfolio/structure change (new entity, channel or format); or an external-audit PFRS 8 query (W95/W351)
Frequency: Annual (AFS cycle); per structural-change event
Volume: 5 operating entities plus the store/DC/HQ/ecommerce and category views aggregated into the reportable-segment set; 1 annual segment-note disclosure package; ~205-location operating data rolled into the CODM&#x27;s review structure
Owner: Corporate Controller
Participants: CFO (chief-operating-decision-maker), FP&amp;A Manager, Chief Accountant, Segment finance leads (entity accountants), External Audit Team, Corporate Secretary (filing calendar)
Source: workflow W5531 — PFRS 8 Operating-Segment Reporting, CODM Disclosure Package &amp; Segment-Note Production</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5531_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5531_Lane1" name="Corporate Controller">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5531_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5531_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5531_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5531_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5531_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5531_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5531_Lane2" name="FP&amp;A Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5531_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5531_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5531_End12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5531_Start4" name="The annual AFS cycle (W9B year-end close feeding the W481 SEC filing calendar); a change…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5531_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5531_Task5" name="CODM &amp; segment-structure confirmation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: CODM &amp; segment-structure confirmation: confirm the chief-operating-decision-maker designation (CFO, per board delegation) and the operating segments reflected in the CODM&#x27;s actual review package — the W1653 monthly executive performance review (entity P&amp;Ls, store/DC/HQ views, ecommerce channel) and the W102/W1656 category margin reviews
Responsible (R): Corporate Controller
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: ~4 hours/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5531_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5531_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5531_Task6" name="Segment data assembly">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Segment data assembly: extract per-segment revenue, results on the measure the CODM uses, interest, depreciation &amp; amortization, and capex; build the reconciliation of segment revenue, profit and assets to the consolidated totals per the PFRS 8 reconciliation requirement, tied to the W9B trial balances
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A Manager / Chief Accountant
Accountable (A): Corporate Controller
Duration: ~16 hours/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5531_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5531_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5531_Task7" name="Aggregation &amp; restatement criteria">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Aggregation &amp; restatement criteria: document any aggregation of operating segments with similar economic characteristics; where the internal reporting structure changed, restate prior-period segment data and record the basis
Responsible (R): Corporate Controller
Accountable (A): Corporate Controller
Duration: ~4 hours/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5531_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5531_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5531_Task8" name="Entity-wide disclosures">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Entity-wide disclosures: products/services revenue splits, the single-geography (Philippine) disclosure with major-market context, and major-customer tests (revenue ≥ 10% per customer) against the W107/W3307 concentration data
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A Manager
Accountable (A): Corporate Controller
Duration: inside the Step-2 assembly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5531_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5531_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5531_Task9" name="Audit walkthrough">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Audit walkthrough: segment-note PBC package for the W351/W95 audit; walkthrough evidence that the segment measure matches the CODM package (the W637 control loop)
Responsible (R): Corporate Controller / Chief Accountant
Accountable (A): Corporate Controller
Duration: ~8 hours/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5531_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5531_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5531_Task10" name="Production &amp; filing">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Production &amp; filing: draft the segment note into the AFS on the W481 filing calendar; cross-check the disclosed segments and measures against the W1657 board governance package for consistency
Responsible (R): Corporate Controller
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: ~16 hours/year incl. Step-4 drafting</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5531_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5531_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5531_Task11" name="Change monitoring">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Change monitoring: annual refresh trigger review — flag any change in the CODM package, segment composition or measure definition feeding the next cycle
Responsible (R): Corporate Controller
Accountable (A): Corporate Controller
Duration: ≈ 4 hours/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5531_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5531_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5531_End12" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5531_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5531_Annotation13">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-292 (ensure controlled execution — FP&amp;A &amp; Reporting (PA-17.4).) | - operational: the segment note may not be drafted from any package other than the CODM&#x27;s own review extracts | - operational: Corporate Controller sign-off on the reconciliation to consolidated totals before audit delivery
Owner: Corporate Controller</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
